WEBVTT

00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:08.470
It's just taking a picture.

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:11.340
Why don't you two go yourselves?

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:13.000
Did you say something?

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:17.410
But is there really one? A ghost, that is.

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:19.250
Yuko said so.

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:21.880
From a window, there's a white shadow...

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:24.650
Scary, scary, scary, scary!

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:25.550
Asami...

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:28.650
We're friends, right? Isn't that right?!

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:32.560
Make sure you go INSIDE and take the photo.

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:34.060
Okay.

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:35.460
Got it?!

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:38.170
We'll be waiting for the e-mail!

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:40.400
If you run away, we'll punish you tomorrow!

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:50.700
There's no way there's a ghost.

00:00:58.650 --> 00:01:01.750
Hey there, don't jerk me around!

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:08.560
If you want us to relocate, bring some money.

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:12.530
But you haven't paid your rent in three years.

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:17.010
We're living in this apartment
complex to prevent crime.

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:19.630
We're the ones who'd like to
get money from you.

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:24.410
Hello...

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:26.310
Yeah, it's me.

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:28.910
It didn't do any good.

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:37.550
Hello? What's the matter? Hello?

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.100
Hello...

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:44.100
That is, well...

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:46.800
Well, this old man fell down, and...

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:50.310
I was just passing by.

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:53.400
Is it all right if I call an ambulance?

00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:58.240
Just now...

00:02:07.070 --> 00:02:09.070
<i>Norikonda sabaibaru cousutaa</i>

00:02:07.070 --> 00:02:09.040
The survival roller coaster we got on

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:11.810
There's no need to give up,
run by the highway

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:11.510
<i>Akirame muyoude run by the highway</i>

00:02:11.510 --> 00:02:13.380
<i>Kimiwa inochi karagara</i>

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:13.580
You just barely escaped with your life

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:15.910
<i>Atashitachimo nodoga karakara</i>

00:02:13.580 --> 00:02:16.180
We're thirsty

00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:18.110
<i>Kyokugento mugendai</i>

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:18.320
Extremities and infinity

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:20.450
<i>Tomo ni sorette mugendai</i>

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:20.680
Together, they form a fantasy

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:22.350
<i>Kamaeta me hibana chiri</i>

00:02:20.680 --> 00:02:22.550
The eyes, squaring away, are
throwing out sparks

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:25.380
<i>Oni-san kochira to shita o dasu</i>

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:25.610
"You're it! This way, " you say,
as you stick your tongue out

00:02:26.520 --> 00:02:27.610
<i>Wink</i>

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:27.680
Wink

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:31.290
<i>Kyouretsuna itamini kansha</i>

00:02:29.530 --> 00:02:31.500
Grateful for the excruciating pain

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:33.630
<i>Power to iu na no rei de henkan</i>

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:33.930
I'm restored by a gratitude
known as power

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:39.540
<i>Mou sorosoro okaeri asobareta houga
iinodewa naide shouka</i>

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:39.740
Perhaps it would be better too return soon?

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:48.440
<i>Matsugeno sukima umeruyouni aimeiku</i>

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:48.680
As though filling in the gaps between
the eyelashes, eye make

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:55.750
<i>Kokorono sukima umeruyouni I take</i>

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:55.950
As though filling in the gaps of
my heart, I take

00:02:55.750 --> 00:03:00.220
<i>Gekiretsu panchide gyakuni takamaru</i>

00:02:55.950 --> 00:03:00.420
On the contrary, the intensity is heightened
by a powerful punch

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:04.690
<i>Yabai shiuchi hodo yokei moechauwa</i>

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:04.760
The worse I'm treated, the more I get fired up

00:03:04.690 --> 00:03:09.060
<i>Mouretsu panchide atashi takaburu</i>

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:09.200
I get worked up over an intense punch

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:17.490
<i>Sonna koto shite kurete arigatou</i>

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:18.040
Thank you for doing such a thing

00:03:18.110 --> 00:03:20.010
<i>Sukima sukima sukimani mimai</i>

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:20.210
A gap, a gap, pay a sympathy visit

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:22.010
<i>Janai janai itainjanai?</i>

00:03:20.210 --> 00:03:22.180
Doesn't it, doesn't it, doesn't it hurt?

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:23.680
<i>Mimai tsurai? ltai? Yabai?</i>

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:23.950
Is the visit painful? Does it hurt?
Is it dangerous?

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:28.310
<i>lkitai itai shitai, lkitai itai shitai</i>

00:03:23.950 --> 00:03:28.620
I want to go, I want to stay, I want to do it

00:03:31.510 --> 00:03:37.650
<i>Shell of Sorrow</i>

00:03:33.410 --> 00:03:38.110
If you weren't around, I don't know what would
have become of my husband.

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:41.050
Thank you very much, Ms. Asami.

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:42.650
Oh, no problem.

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:45.190
Oh, what to do about this.

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:48.520
Those guys have no intention of
leaving the premises.

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:51.420
Well, I'll go home now.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:56.230
By the way, did you have some business
in that apartment complex?

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:57.670
Well...

00:03:57.670 --> 00:04:00.230
Ah, that is...

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:04.840
A haunted mansion? That's a good one.

00:04:05.210 --> 00:04:09.810
My friends told me to go take a
picture of a ghost, so...

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:13.850
That's all right. We left it alone because
we planned on wrecking it.

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:16.650
It's not so strange to have such
rumors going around.

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:17.990
Wrecking it?

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:21.260
As you saw, the building is becoming very old.

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:24.330
If it crumbles, there's going to be a big disaster

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:28.130
so the government office gave me some stern
warnings to get it taken down by next month.

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:30.930
The other tenants have already relocated

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:33.230
and we'd like to tear it down immediately, but...

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:36.440
Some thugs have set up camp there.

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:39.540
They're trying to use our situation
to their advantage

00:04:39.540 --> 00:04:42.740
and are attempting to extort money from us.

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:47.480
I've tried discussing this with them many times,
but this is the result after all.

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:50.890
People are a lot scarier than ghosts.

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:52.650
Uh, well...

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:59.080
I know of people who do dangerous things and
can handle things at your place.

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:01.260
In other words,

00:05:01.260 --> 00:05:04.130
all we need to do is to chase the gangsters
out of the apartment complex?

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:08.500
It's an easy job. Easy. Let's take it easy.

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:11.910
If we're having Asami get work for us, what
standing does that leave you in?

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:13.640
If you can't stand it, sit down. Beg.

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:15.280
The customer pays money, money is god.

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:17.710
Now, shall we go?

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:19.280
Go where?

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:20.550
To the hospital.

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:23.570
We need to get the story in detail from the client.

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:26.650
First, we need to talk about money. Oh, yeah.

00:05:29.520 --> 00:05:32.890
Since we have free time, shall we
go to the haunted mansion?

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:34.030
Yeah.

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:35.730
Asami, show us the way.

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:36.920
Sure!

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:42.540
This place does certainly seem fishy.

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:43.660
You said it.

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:46.840
What, did you see something?

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:49.140
A girl wearing white clothes...

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:51.810
Impossible. That's just not possible.

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:54.280
No, I've seen her too.

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:57.150
If I'm not mistaken, she had a
stuffed rabbit with her.

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:04.890
The light's on so that means
someone is still living there.

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:08.960
So that's it. For a moment there, I thought...

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:10.290
Hey!

00:06:15.570 --> 00:06:19.170
What? Is this a pro wrestling agency?

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:22.740
Mr. Ouya, I perfectly understand the situation.

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:24.650
Please get them out of there somehow

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:26.850
before the day the place is to be wrecked.

00:06:26.850 --> 00:06:28.820
Please.

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:32.090
"Taking care of business quickly
and reasonably,"

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:33.820
is the company's motto so...

00:06:33.820 --> 00:06:34.790
How about this?

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:42.450
Then how about this?

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:48.170
Mr. Ouya, do you understand?

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:50.640
I can't go any lower than this.

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:58.940
That includes the necessary expenses, right?

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:00.910
Well, oh, all right.

00:07:03.490 --> 00:07:06.820
The ones sitting in the agency are Baba,
the group leader,

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:12.030
Kira, the group commander, Ouki and
Sakaguchi, group members.

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:14.960
That Kira pro wrestler guy is the problem.

00:07:15.800 --> 00:07:17.900
Keep the expenses down!

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:19.700
This is the ultimate order to you!

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:21.400
What are you so angry about?

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:23.370
A basement bargain price was negotiated.

00:07:23.370 --> 00:07:27.040
What?! That's no good.
What were you doing, Pops?

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:31.240
Well, it's not going to go so easily
since they're quite shrewd.

00:07:32.210 --> 00:07:35.980
Well, I'm sure wrecking the place is
going to cost money too.

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:37.850
Min-min massage classroom!

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:40.220
You'll become refreshed, deep down
into your marrow today too!

00:07:40.220 --> 00:07:41.190
Too!

00:07:41.590 --> 00:07:44.430
First, I'd like to plant this thing, but...

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:46.090
What should I do?

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:48.760
I just thought of a nice plan!

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:55.270
I told her not to overdo it, but...

00:07:55.270 --> 00:07:57.970
A time when she doesn't overdo things...

00:07:58.310 --> 00:08:00.040
Hardly ever exists.

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:01.900
Is this going to be all right?

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:13.320
It looks like the inside of Pop's head!

00:08:13.990 --> 00:08:15.220
What's that supposed to mean?

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:16.520
No idea.

00:08:19.030 --> 00:08:23.330
Room 402, room 402...

00:08:25.570 --> 00:08:26.660
There it is.

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:33.740
Who the hell are you?

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:35.740
Oh, good evening.

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:39.010
Well, would you like to take advantage of our
door-to-door massage service?

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:40.970
Massage?

00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:45.240
Yes, we're going all over the place to
promote our grand opening.

00:08:46.890 --> 00:08:47.950
Wait here!

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:51.860
Maybe this plan was a little forced...

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:55.760
Come in.

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:57.560
Score!

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:06.270
I brought her.

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:07.570
Yeah!

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:14.540
Say, you're pretty.

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:16.650
Thank you!

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:19.720
Well, please lay down.

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:21.090
Yeah.

00:09:21.890 --> 00:09:23.830
You're quite tense.

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:25.890
Some place to set it up...

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:27.130
Yo, Babe!

00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:29.660
Yes? What is it?

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:31.830
I'm not feeling a damned thing.

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:35.170
I'm sorry. I'm still an understudy.

00:09:38.540 --> 00:09:40.640
Then I'll teach you.

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:42.210
Since you came to a place like this,

00:09:42.210 --> 00:09:44.350
this goes too, doesn't it?

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:47.280
Well, no, I don't perform that service.

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:49.320
Hey, Sir...

00:09:49.320 --> 00:09:51.110
Never mind, just come!

00:09:51.550 --> 00:09:53.690
Sir, please don't joke around like this.

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:56.050
It'll be fine! It'll be fine!

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:02.720
I'm sorry. Are your nuts all right?

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:06.790
Why you bitch!

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:15.400
Whoa! The building really looks like it'll collapse!

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:18.080
Not good!

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:20.010
Boss! What happened?

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:24.650
He all of a sudden touched my butt,
so I returned the gesture.

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:26.380
Why you!

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:34.390
That tickles.

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:38.730
Hey, what are you...

00:10:45.940 --> 00:10:47.670
Say your prayers, Babe.

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:50.970
The Way of the Extreme is the Only Path

00:10:52.550 --> 00:10:54.710
What the hell are you?!

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:58.320
Don't move! If you do, you won't live
long enough to eat dinner.

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:00.690
Pops...

00:11:00.690 --> 00:11:02.320
See ya!

00:11:04.590 --> 00:11:05.860
For real?!

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:06.920
Die!

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:18.800
This way, this way! Hurry!

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:23.200
Harada! Go, go, go!

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:32.510
So she had accomplices.

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:50.970
Here?

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:53.960
Yeah, there, there.

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:57.110
Since the building was old, you were saved.

00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:59.840
You did overdo it after all.

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:03.950
But he touched my butt!

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:06.850
So what? I did my job like I was supposed to!

00:12:07.090 --> 00:12:08.820
Like you were supposed to?

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:10.150
You got a problem?

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:13.690
We'll take turns guarding the outer perimeter.

00:12:13.690 --> 00:12:15.920
If you see anyone suspicious,
grab a hold of him.

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:19.990
It looks like the success of
our job was just halved.

00:12:20.230 --> 00:12:22.340
Now they're on alert.

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:25.330
Oh great, now we can't be carefree
about getting close to them.

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:29.280
But he touched my butt!

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:33.640
That being the case, I guess I'll
have to ask for his help.

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:35.210
His?

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:44.120
Hi!

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:46.790
What's the matter?!

00:12:47.560 --> 00:12:49.150
That massage bitch is here!

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:52.700
Say what? Sakaguchi, you go too.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:54.560
Yes, Sir.

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:57.170
Don't let her escape!

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.540
I know!

00:13:00.510 --> 00:13:02.530
The pro wrestler and the young guy
are coming out.

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:03.800
Gotcha.

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:08.580
She's not here! She escaped.

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:11.140
Over there! Don't let her escape!

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:12.990
Yoo-hoo!

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:14.580
How dare she taunt us?

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:26.690
Now you can't escape!

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:39.010
What the hell is this?

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:43.050
For attempted assault on a woman

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:46.650
and illegal possession of weapons,
you're under arrest.

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:48.860
Huh? What's that mean?

00:13:48.860 --> 00:13:50.480
How long are you going to hold onto me?!

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:04.770
Thank you very much for a job well done!

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:15.680
Things one ought to have are colleagues from
the past and strong relationships.

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:18.950
Just keep yourself hidden and let this be the
only time you stick your neck out like this.

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:22.390
This time, I wanted to settle things peacefully.

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:24.020
Ha, right...

00:14:24.530 --> 00:14:25.920
See ya, Chief.

00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:29.760
Say, wasn't the police chief guy upset?

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:32.390
His face looks like that three hundred
and sixty five days a year.

00:14:32.530 --> 00:14:36.400
Well now, the pro wrestler and the young
guy have been taken care of, so...

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:38.370
There are just two of them left.

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:40.640
Thank you very much.

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:44.970
Mr. Ouya, it's a little early to say thanks to us.

00:14:45.180 --> 00:14:47.010
No, it's all right.

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:51.890
As long as those two are gone,
the rest will be...

00:14:51.890 --> 00:14:52.720
The rest will be?

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:53.790
What's this mean?

00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:57.060
With the two who are left,
they don't have any muscle,

00:14:57.060 --> 00:15:00.360
so we think we can somehow discuss things.

00:15:00.360 --> 00:15:02.900
You're taking the gangsters too lightly.

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:10.570
It'll be all right. We'll pay you now
so this completes our contract.

00:15:10.570 --> 00:15:15.240
As long as we get our money, oh well.
We don't have any complaints.

00:15:15.240 --> 00:15:16.410
Well, see you then.

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:18.900
Thanks. "Thanks?" Am I from the other
side of the country or something?

00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:24.080
I wonder if this is all right as is?

00:15:25.750 --> 00:15:26.910
Asami?

00:15:32.090 --> 00:15:33.390
So you were here.

00:15:33.590 --> 00:15:37.050
I was a bit concerned about the
girl who was over there.

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:41.170
That girl was looking at me from
the window when I fell.

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:50.200
Why did they get arrested?!

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:53.580
In addition, the cops were led by the
departmental police chief!

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:55.450
What the hell?!

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:59.150
The only thing I can think of

00:15:59.150 --> 00:16:02.020
is that old man Ouya must have hired
someone to kick us out.

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:05.890
That old fart, how dare he do that?!

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:08.490
Harada, still at it?

00:16:10.230 --> 00:16:12.830
Asami went home? I'm doing Asami's voice.

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:14.770
She broke off from us part of
the way over here.

00:16:14.770 --> 00:16:16.440
She said she needed to go someplace.

00:16:16.440 --> 00:16:18.840
While I was at it, I wanted to treat
her to my cooking,

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:20.210
which I have a lot of pride in.

00:16:20.210 --> 00:16:21.970
But all you did was to boil the vermicelli.

00:16:22.310 --> 00:16:26.610
The way I boil them is on par with how
they're boiled professionally.

00:16:26.850 --> 00:16:29.180
Harada, the job's finished,

00:16:29.180 --> 00:16:32.550
so come here, sit down and be merry. Come on!

00:16:32.950 --> 00:16:36.550
Son of a bitch! Damn!

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:46.320
What the hell is this?

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:51.740
Why is this thing...

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:53.440
You got to be kidding me!

00:16:53.440 --> 00:16:54.500
What?

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:39.450
What?

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:41.520
Damn...

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:45.390
But I wonder when that girl's family will move?

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:46.830
Girl?

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:49.690
Yeah, looks like there's someone
else living there.

00:17:50.300 --> 00:17:52.270
I saw a girl there.

00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:53.830
What are you talking about?

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:57.100
All the other residents in that apartment
complex relocated ages ago

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:58.300
and only the gangsters are left.

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:01.080
That's what old man Ouya said anyway.

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:02.800
But Asami saw her too.

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:06.550
Mikura?

00:18:06.550 --> 00:18:07.920
Harada, let's go!

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:10.250
Ah, I'm busy right now!

00:18:10.990 --> 00:18:13.120
When we first went to the apartment complex,

00:18:13.120 --> 00:18:15.210
remember me saying I saw a girl there?

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:16.720
Yeah.

00:18:16.460 --> 00:18:19.280
She didn't seem like she was alive to me.

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:22.720
What's that mean?

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:24.660
I have a really bad feeling about this!

00:18:25.770 --> 00:18:27.100
Hey, Mikura!

00:18:29.240 --> 00:18:31.140
This stuffed animal...

00:18:33.640 --> 00:18:35.070
Wait!

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:47.450
Hey, where did she go?

00:18:58.500 --> 00:18:59.630
Mr. Ouya...

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:02.570
Ms. Asami, why are you here?

00:19:03.040 --> 00:19:06.770
I wanted to see the girl.

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:08.270
Girl?

00:19:09.140 --> 00:19:14.380
A girl wearing white clothes. She dropped this.

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:16.880
Why do you even have that?

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:20.150
What? That's because I picked it up.

00:19:20.150 --> 00:19:21.360
Liar!

00:19:21.360 --> 00:19:24.360
You know, don't you?

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:26.220
What? Know what?

00:19:26.690 --> 00:19:30.060
You're a kid but you're threatening an adult?!

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:41.310
You're a bad child for lying.

00:19:41.310 --> 00:19:43.810
We need to punish you severely,

00:19:43.810 --> 00:19:45.640
just like the other child.

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:53.080
There's no place to escape.

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:58.120
Someone help me.

00:20:02.360 --> 00:20:07.300
Have you forgotten? This apartment
complex is my property.

00:20:28.860 --> 00:20:33.130
With these two, looking for an opening and
killing them isn't a problem at all.

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:36.530
However, that giant fella was another story.

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:46.800
Asami!

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:56.880
What the?!

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:01.690
What's this?

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:11.730
Don't look! Don't look! Don't look!
Don't look!!

00:21:12.930 --> 00:21:14.990
She's our daughter.

00:21:15.940 --> 00:21:20.910
She the daughter we killed forty years ago.

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:22.980
Killed her?

00:21:22.980 --> 00:21:25.310
Why did you come out?

00:21:25.310 --> 00:21:27.450
We hid you all this time.

00:21:27.450 --> 00:21:30.140
All this time, all this time, all...

00:21:31.420 --> 00:21:35.260
Say, you really shouldn't have
come out like that.

00:21:35.260 --> 00:21:36.890
You're a bad child.

00:21:36.890 --> 00:21:39.590
That's why we have to punish you.

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:43.060
Now listen carefully.

00:21:43.060 --> 00:21:44.860
The stuffed animal...

00:21:51.770 --> 00:21:55.170
The gangsters' room used to be
Mr. Ouya and his wife's room.

00:21:55.840 --> 00:21:58.810
Before tearing it down, they wanted
to dispose of the body

00:21:58.810 --> 00:22:00.750
but the gangsters settled in.

00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:04.450
Well, if you were to poke a hole in the wall,
it was sure to be uncovered.

00:22:04.690 --> 00:22:08.020
The wall crumbled and she was found after all.

00:22:09.190 --> 00:22:15.400
That girl, she seemed so sad and I thought
maybe I could be something for her.

00:22:15.400 --> 00:22:17.260
Be what?

00:22:17.260 --> 00:22:19.230
A real

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:20.830
friend.

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:27.300
I wonder why she was killed?

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:31.080
That couple was apparently
extremely strict

00:22:31.080 --> 00:22:34.920
and tended to apply rather harsh punishments,
and then by accident...

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:36.970
But that's!

00:22:37.820 --> 00:22:40.810
Well, it's a very common story these days.

00:22:41.790 --> 00:22:44.380
The reason she died doesn't matter.

00:22:45.590 --> 00:22:48.560
Once you're dead, the reason is

00:22:48.560 --> 00:22:50.550
absolutely meaningless.

00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:53.300
Ms. Mikura...

00:22:53.670 --> 00:22:56.300
I'm glad I couldn't see her.

00:22:56.300 --> 00:22:59.000
More like, I still can't believe this.

00:23:00.510 --> 00:23:03.510
After all, no matter what the reason is,
humans are a lot scarier than ghosts.

00:23:03.510 --> 00:23:05.950
Yodelay, yodelay, I'm good at yodeling.

00:23:05.950 --> 00:23:07.470
Hey, the girl's smiling now!

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:10.220
<i>Shell of Sorrow</i>

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:20.830
<i>Jyareau konyano aabento wa</i>

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:20.690
Playing around, tonight's evening
concert will be

00:23:20.690 --> 00:23:25.370
The aridness of nature which lurks
in the warmth

00:23:20.830 --> 00:23:25.570
<i>Nukumorini hisomu yaseino kawaki</i>

00:23:25.370 --> 00:23:26.570
OH- AH-

00:23:25.570 --> 00:23:26.740
<i>OH-AH-</i>

00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:31.540
If there's too much nutrition

00:23:26.740 --> 00:23:31.640
<i>Hitsuyouna youbunwa takusan arisugiruto</i>

00:23:31.540 --> 00:23:35.510
They become divided based on
how sweet it is

00:23:31.640 --> 00:23:35.550
<i>Amasagotoni wakerareru</i>

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:42.780
Absentmindedly, touching, the beginning

00:23:35.550 --> 00:23:42.990
<i>Bonyari, tezawari, hajimari</i>

00:23:42.780 --> 00:23:47.890
What's the deal with immediately giving me

00:23:42.990 --> 00:23:47.920
<i>Nandakano kankaku no ai dake</i>

00:23:47.890 --> 00:23:52.560
The kind of love which only has a
certain kind of feeling?

00:23:47.920 --> 00:23:52.730
<i>Sugu kurerunotte, dounano?</i>

00:23:52.560 --> 00:23:57.300
The more bitter the repelled honey is

00:23:52.730 --> 00:23:57.430
<i>Hajikareta nigai mitsu hodo</i>

00:23:57.300 --> 00:24:06.170
Perhaps it's that much better

00:23:57.430 --> 00:24:06.400
<i>Moshikashitara sugoku iikamo shirenai</i>

00:24:11.210 --> 00:24:16.180
What's the deal with immediately giving me

00:24:11.350 --> 00:24:16.350
<i>Nandakano kankaku no ai dake</i>

00:24:16.180 --> 00:24:20.890
The kind of love which only has a
certain kind of feeling?

00:24:16.350 --> 00:24:21.090
<i>Sugu kurerunotte, dounano?</i>

00:24:20.890 --> 00:24:25.690
The more bitter the repelled honey is

00:24:21.090 --> 00:24:25.830
<i>Hajikareta nigai mitsu hodo</i>

00:24:25.690 --> 00:24:35.530
Perhaps it's that much better

00:24:25.830 --> 00:24:35.530
<i>Moshikashitara sugoku iikamo shirenai</i>

00:24:40.310 --> 00:24:55.480
<i>Next Episode
Shell of Thoughts</i>

00:24:41.880 --> 00:24:44.140
All of a sudden, there's a job offer and the
reward is fifty million yen!

00:24:44.140 --> 00:24:45.610
All right, baby! We're just excited.

00:24:45.610 --> 00:24:46.980
But this just might only be a dream.

00:24:46.980 --> 00:24:50.250
If I could see any dream I want, I would become
a famous person who was dreaming.

00:24:50.250 --> 00:24:53.090
What about you, Mikura? What? Awesome,
great, wonderful, excellent,

00:24:53.090 --> 00:24:54.250
marvelous, beautiful...

00:24:54.250 --> 00:24:55.480
Someone needs to stop this.
